OL,3,GNEWSAHow an 83-year-old loan shark     
OL,4,Asparked a school's campaign            
OL,6,FThe story of an 83-year-old grandmother
OL,7,Fwho became the oldest loan shark to be 
OL,8,Fprosecuted in the UK stopped Caroline  
OL,9,FLewis in her tracks.                   
OL,11,FThe assistant principal was attending a
OL,12,Fsafeguarding conference when she heard 
OL,13,Fhow the pensioner had been illegally   
OL,14,Flending money to parents on a school   
OL,15,Fplayground.                            
OL,17,F"It made me think, wow, you don't      
OL,18,Factually know who a loan shark is,"    
OL,19,Fsaid Lewis, who realised her           
OL,20,FStoke-on-Trent school community needed 
OL,21,Fto be more aware of the dangers of     
OL,22,Fillegal money lending.                 
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
