OL,3,GNEWSAHow an 83-year-old loan shark     
OL,4,Asparked a school's campaign            
OL,6,FAs a result, Star Academy, Sandyford,  
OL,7,Fhas become the first school in the     
OL,8,Fcountry to be accredited by the England
OL,9,FIllegal Money Lending Team (IMLT) for  
OL,10,Feducating children and families about  
OL,11,Fthe risks of loan sharks.              
